stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ReceiveRequest : POST /api/move

    ReceiveRequest --> VerifyJwt : Extract Bearer token

    state verify_jwt <<choice>>
    VerifyJwt --> verify_jwt

    verify_jwt --> RejectUnauthorised : Missing / invalid JWT
    verify_jwt --> CheckRole : JWT valid

    state check_role <<choice>>
    CheckRole --> check_role

    check_role --> RejectForbidden : role == viewer
    check_role --> ValidateCoordinates : role == operator

    state check_coords <<choice>>
    ValidateCoordinates --> check_coords

    check_coords --> AuditAndReject422 : x or y outside 0..20
    check_coords --> SendToRobot : Coordinates valid

    state robot_result <<choice>>
    SendToRobot --> robot_result

    robot_result --> AuditSuccess : robot 200 OK
    robot_result --> AuditError   : robot 5xx / unreachable (after retries)

    AuditSuccess --> [*]
    AuditError --> [*]
    AuditAndReject422 --> [*]
    RejectUnauthorised --> [*]
    RejectForbidden --> [*]